        <mxCell id="tr_l4a_pre" value="[L4a] Pre-Test Diagnostik Awal (Baseline T1)&#xa;• Dilakukan saat pertama kali mendaftar jalur&#xa;• Mengukur baseline kompetensi awal (Contoh: Skor 56/100)&#xa;• Standar pengukur kenaikan kompetensi Metrik T1 (≥25%)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#082f49;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="lane_operator">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="250" width="340" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="tr_l2_dash" value="[L2] Beranda Peserta &amp; Roadmap Misi&#xa;• Level: Operator Magang ➔ Muda (400) ➔ Madya (1200)&#xa;• Peta Misi 5 Tingkat: Pengenalan, Normal, Gangguan, Kelulusan&#xa;• Saran Belajar Otomatis AI Smart Advisor (PRD §11)&#xa;• Status Piagam: Belum Memenuhi Syarat" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#082f49;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="lane_operator">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="360" width="340" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="tr_l3_track" value="[L3] Pemilihan Jalur Pembelajaran&#xa;• 3 Kartu Jalur PRD §7: IPA (9), Distribusi (7), Terpadu (17)&#xa;• Tanpa prasyarat untuk memilih Terpadu&#xa;• 1 Jalur Aktif; Misi lulus dihitung otomatis saat pindah" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#082f49;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="lane_operator">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="485" width="340" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="tr_l4_modquiz" value="[L4] Modul Materi &amp; Kuis 5 Soal Pra-Misi&#xa;• Contoh Konsisten: IPA-06 Lonjakan Kekeruhan (T3 Sulit)&#xa;• Briefing Mentor: Operator Senior (Pak Slamet)&#xa;• Batas Mutu Kritis Permenkes No. 2/2023 (&lt;3 NTU)&#xa;• Kuis 5 Soal: Nilai ≥ 60 membuka Simulator (+XP Kuis)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#082f49;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="lane_operator">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="600" width="340" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="tr_quiz_gate" value="Kuis ≥ 60?" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0369a1;strokeColor=#38bdf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="lane_operator">
          <mxGeometry x="270" y="725" width="140" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="tr_l5_hmi" value="[L5] Workspace Simulator SCADA HMI&#xa;• Mimic Dinamis Real-Time 1 Hz (Intake s/d Reservoir)&#xa;• Unit Distribusi Nonaktif/Redup pada Misi IPA&#xa;• Titik Pantau: Tekanan bar, Debit L/s, Sisa Klor mg/L&#xa;• Sistem Alarm ISA-18.2 (Bentuk Simbol, 4 Status, Auto-Clear)&#xa;• Tombol Clear Nonaktif jika Penyebab Belum Selesai" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#082f49;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="lane_operator">
          <mxGeometry x="160" y="815" width="360" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Node L5a: Pop-up Narasi Titik Kontrol -->
        <mxCell id="tr_l5a_narrative" value="[L5a] Pop-up Narasi Titik Kontrol (Koagulasi)&#xa;• Ikon 'i' dibuka kapan saja tanpa kurangi skor&#xa;• 6 Bagian: Definisi, Parameter Pantau, Kontrol, Dampak, SOP, Referensi&#xa;• Kotak SOP Lokal Lembaga (Balai Nusantara) &amp; Tooltip" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c4a6e;strokeColor=#38bdf8;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10.5;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="lane_operator">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="940" width="280" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="tr_l6_scoring" value="[L6] Hasil Evaluasi Skor 4 Komponen (PRD §8)&#xa;• Ketepatan 38/40 + Respons 22/25 + Stabilitas 15/20 + Alarm 13/15 = 88&#xa;• Bintang: 2★ (Rentang 85–94) · XP: 88 × 2,0 = +176 XP&#xa;• Level Operator Muda ➔ Menuju Madya (820 XP)&#xa;• Lencana Baru Terbuka: 'Respons Kilat'&#xa;• Debriefing Tokoh Mentor: Operator Senior (Pak Slamet)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#082f49;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="lane_operator">
          <mxGeometry x="160" y="940" width="360" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="tr_pass_check" value="Skor ≥ KKM?&#xa;(Biasa ≥70, Kelulusan ≥80)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0369a1;strokeColor=#38bdf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="lane_operator">
          <mxGeometry x="250" y="1075" width="180" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="tr_l7_gamify" value="[L7] Galeri Lencana &amp; Papan Peringkat&#xa;• 8 Lencana PRD: Penjelajah, Respons Kilat, Tanpa Alarm, Mutu, dll&#xa;• Papan Peringkat: Tab Kelompok/Lembaga &amp; Mingguan/All-Time" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#082f49;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="lane_operator">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="1175" width="340" height="75" as="geometry" />
